    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go of the burden\"... that's exactly what it feels like. like there's this constant noise of failing and being alone. you make it sound so peaceful, like just stopping the struggle is the only way to actually find some rest. is that really what it is? just... giving up the fight?",
